  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  name: 
  sentences:
  - A poetic sign?!
  - "\"to przebi\u0107 or not to przebi\u0107, that is the question to be asked\""
  - Your brain is too smooth to understand the context of this sign
  - "You will do a bold assumption that the arrows have przebi\u0107 the target.."
  - "przebi\u0107 means pierce!!! you are a genius.."
  - Might aswell test out your hypothesis
